This repository holds the training pipeline for Malevolent, DRock's LoRA
fine-tunes of Qwen3. It is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE).

Malevolent models are derivatives of these base models by the Qwen team,
Alibaba Cloud, released under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(Copyright 2024 Alibaba Cloud):

  Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B                revision c1899de289a04d12100db370d81485cdf75e47ca
  Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507    revision cdbee75f17c01a7cc42f958dc650907174af0554

Any released Malevolent adapter or merged model is the base above plus a
LoRA delta. The base weights are not modified, and weight-similarity tools
will match a merged model to Qwen3. Each release names its base revision,
dataset hash and adapter hash in adapter_manifest.json.

No model weights are included in this repository yet.
